GENERAL
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  ll                  List files with details + hidden files
  la                  List files with hidden files
  lla                 List files with details + hidden files
  binds               Show system binds
  reload              Reload .zshrc
  ep                  Export installed packages


GIT
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  gs                  Git status
  ga                  Git add
  gc                  Git commit
  gp                  Git push
  gu                  Safe git update


PACMAN
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  p                   Run pacman
  pi                  Install package
  ps                  Search packages
  pf                  Search package files
  pu                  Update system
  pr                  Remove package
  pss                 List installed packages
  p!                  Install universal package list


YAY
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  y                   Run yay
  yi                  Install package
  ys                  Search packages
  yu                  Update system + AUR packages
  yr                  Remove package
  yq                  Show package information
  yout                Remove orphaned packages
  y!                  Install universal package list


DIRECTORY
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  hd                  Go to home directory
  df                  Go to dotfiles
  cfg                 Go to ~/.config/


SYSTEM
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  theme               Edit Quickshell theme
